t58:subClassOfRel a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "subClassOf (as an object property)" ;
    rdfs:comment "Stand-in for rdfs:subClassOf inside the concept_hierarchy.ttl property chains (C subClassOfRel D reads: concept C, taken as an individual, is a subclass of concept D). Introduced by T58 because rdfs:subClassOf is not an OWL 2 DL object property." .

