qsr:DC a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "rcc8_DC" ;
    rdfs:comment "x and y are disconnected: region(x) and region(y) share no cell and no 4-adjacent pair of cells. Grounding: region(x) = cells of x plus the cells x encloses (cells outside x not 4-connected to the grid border through cells outside x); the second argument is an object; x != y. Randell, Cui & Cohn 1992 (RCC-8)." ;
